Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:17:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Kompakt: recovery: two inks on the e-ink panel

Draw every recovery element in pure black or pure white, so nothing
dithers on the e-ink panel.

Change-Id: Ib75d10c5af8f13ba4df5d81fe7fb883db55ac36b
